Some few-shot examples may be useful:
Query:
--Description:  ❶  Peek at the columns that are certainly present and inspect a few rows, focusing on 2021 data.
SELECT 
  "event_id",
  "event_type",
  "state",
  "cz_fips_code",
  "cz_name",
  "event_latitude",
  "event_longitude"
FROM NOAA_DATA_PLUS.NOAA_HISTORIC_SEVERE_STORMS."STORMS_2021"
LIMIT 20;
