Query:
--Description:  ❷  Look for the exact spellings of hurricane-related event types that appear in 2021.  
SELECT DISTINCT 
  "event_type"
FROM NOAA_DATA_PLUS.NOAA_HISTORIC_SEVERE_STORMS."STORMS_2021"
WHERE "event_type" ILIKE '%hurricane%'
LIMIT 20;
Answer:
event_type
hurricane
marine hurricane/typhoon
